 ### Parameters
-*   **Chunk Size:** Typically $16 \times 16 \times 16$ or $32 \times 32 \times 32$ [S2, S4, unofficial].
-*   **Leaf Render Mode:** `Fast` (leaves opaque), `Smart` (leaves cull like fast but check neighbors), `Fancy` (leaves transparent for meshing) [S4, unofficial].
-*   **Sea Level:** Integer Y coordinate. Water blocks with top face at sea level use planar reflection; others use sky reflection [S4, unofficial].
-*   **Min Mesh Distance:** Configurable distance from player to trigger greedy meshing updates. $0$ disables optimization [S5, unofficial].
