+### Halo Padding
+Generating chunks with a +1 block border (total +2 in each dimension) to ensure geometry continuity across chunk boundaries [S11, unofficial].
+
+### Chunk Geometry
+Using cubical $16 \times 16 \times 16$ chunks for display lists, unlike for load and save (which may use world-height chunks) [S12, unofficial]. Cubical chunks reduce the reason to frustum cull individual chunks compared to world-height chunks [S12, unofficial].
